<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#14231d">
<base href="./">
<title>Alazhar City Delivery | سوبرماركت وصيدلية — الحي السادس مدينة نصر</title>
<meta name="description" content="سوبرماركت وصيدلية لطلبة جامعة الأزهر في الحي السادس. اختار اللي محتاجه، ابعت طلبك، وخليه يوصل لحد بابك بسهولة.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Alazhar City Delivery">
<meta property="og:description" content="طلبات السوبرماركت والصيدلية لطلبة الأزهر — بسيطة من أول الاختيار لحد الاستلام.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:locale" content="ar_EG">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://amh012-hu.github.io/AlazharCityDelivery/images/og.png">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="64x64" href="icons/favicon-64.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="icons/apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Alazhar City">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root{
  --brand:#e94b3c; --brand-d:#bd3027; --brand-l:#fff0ed;
  --green:#0a8150; --green-l:#e5f6ee;
  --ink:#14231d; --muted:#69736e; --line:#e7ebe8; --bg:#f6f7f4; --card:#fff;
  --r:18px; --sh:0 3px 14px rgba(20,35,29,.07); --sh2:0 14px 32px rgba(20,35,29,.14);
  --safe-b:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:150px}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:'Cairo','Segoe UI',Tahoma,sans-serif;padding-bottom:calc(90px + var(--safe-b));-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
body.lock{overflow:hidden}
button,input,textarea,select{font:inherit;color:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
img{max-width:100%}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid rgba(255,87,34,.5);outline-offset:2px}
.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}
svg.i{width:1.2em;height:1.2em;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex:none}
.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 14px}

/* ---------- Header ---------- */
.top{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--line)}
.flagbar{height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--brand),var(--brand) 48%,#0a8150 48%,#0a8150)}
.bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)) 0 8px}
.logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px;object-fit:cover;background:var(--ink);flex:none;box-shadow:0 5px 12px rgba(20,35,29,.18)}
.loc{flex:1;min-width:0;line-height:1.25}
.loc small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600}
.loc b{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.loc b svg{color:var(--brand)}
.status{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:var(--green-l);color:var(--green);white-space:nowrap}
.status::before{content:"";width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}
.status.closed{background:#fdeaea;color:#d62828}
.status.open::before{animation:blink 1.4s infinite}
@keyframes blink{50%{opacity:.25}}
.icon-btn{position:relative;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px;border:0;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;box-shadow:0 5px 12px rgba(20,35,29,.16);transition:transform .15s,background .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.icon-btn:active{transform:scale(.94)}
.icon-btn.download-btn{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 5px 14px rgba(233,75,60,.32)}
.icon-btn.download-btn:hover{background:var(--brand-d);transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 7px 18px rgba(233,75,60,.45)}
.icon-btn.download-btn:active{transform:scale(.94)}
.icon-btn.download-btn svg{width:1.35em;height:1.35em}
@media(max-width:440px){
  .bar{gap:6px}
  .loc small{display:none}
  .loc b{font-size:.84rem}
  .status{padding:4px 8px;font-size:.68rem}
  .palchip{width:38px;height:38px;font-size:1.15rem}
  .icon-btn{width:38px;height:38px}
}
@media(max-width:350px){
  .status{display:none}
}
.icon-btn .cnt{position:absolute;top:-4px;left:-4px;min-width:20px;height:20px;padding:0 5px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;display:none;place-items:center}
.icon-btn .cnt.show{display:grid}
.icon-btn.bump{animation:bump .35s}
@keyframes bump{40%{transform:scale(1.18)}}
.search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--bg);border:2px solid transparent;border-radius:14px;padding:0 12px;margin-bottom:8px}
.search:focus-within{border-color:var(--brand);background:#fff}
.search svg{color:var(--muted)}
.search input{flex:1;min-width:0;border:0;background:transparent;padding:12px 0;outline:none}
.search button{border:0;background:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.3rem;display:none}
.search.has button{display:block}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;padding-bottom:10px}
.tab{flex:1;border:2px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:8px 6px;font-weight:800;font-size:.88rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px}
.tab[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--brand);background:var(--brand-l);color:var(--brand-d)}
.tab[data-group="pharmacy"][aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--green);background:var(--green-l);color:var(--green)}

/* ---------- Hero ---------- */
.hero{position:relative;margin-top:14px;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--sh2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3)}
.slides{display:flex;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}
.slide{min-width:100%;padding:26px 24px;min-height:178px;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.slide::after{content:"";position:absolute;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);left:-70px;bottom:-110px}
.slide h2{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:900;line-height:1.3}
.slide p{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:.92rem;opacity:.95;font-weight:600}
.slide .cta{border:0;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font-weight:800;border-radius:24px;padding:9px 20px}
.slide .art{font-size:5.2rem;line-height:1;filter:drop-shadow(0 8px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.25));z-index:1}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.slide .art{animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite}@keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-8px) rotate(-4deg)}}}
.dots{position:absolute;bottom:8px;right:0;left:0;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:6px;z-index:2}
.dots button{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;border:0;padding:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)}
.dots button[aria-current="true"]{width:22px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff}

/* ---------- USP ---------- */
.usp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
.usp div{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:12px 6px;text-align:center;font-size:.74rem;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--sh);line-height:1.4;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.usp span{display:block;font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:2px}

/* ---------- Sections ---------- */
.sec{margin-top:22px}
.sec-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}
.sec-head h2{margin:0;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:900;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.sec-head .more{border:0;background:none;color:var(--brand);font-weight:800;font-size:.85rem}
.timer{display:inline-flex;gap:4px;direction:ltr;font-weight:800;font-size:.8rem}
.timer b{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:6px;padding:2px 6px;min-width:26px;text-align:center}

.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(92px,1fr));gap:10px}
.tile{border:0;border-radius:16px;padding:12px 4px 10px;text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.35;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.tile:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--sh)}
.tile:active{transform:scale(.96)}
.tile .em{font-size:2rem;line-height:1}
.tile[aria-pressed="true"]{outline:3px solid var(--brand)}
.hrow{display:flex;gap:10px;overflow-x:auto;padding:2px 2px 10px;scroll-snap-type:x proximity;scrollbar-width:none}
.hrow::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.hrow .card{min-width:150px;max-width:150px;scroll-snap-align:start}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:10px}

.crumb{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:16px}
.chip{border:0;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:6px 14px;font-weight:800;font-size:.82rem}

/* ---------- Product card ---------- */
.card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--r);box-shadow:var(--sh);padding:8px 8px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(20,35,29,.05)}
.card.sold{opacity:.55}
.pic{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:3.6rem;overflow:hidden;background:#f8f9fa}
.pic img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;background:#fff;padding:6px;border-radius:12px;transition:transform .2s ease}
.card:hover .pic img{transform:scale(1.03)}
.badge{position:absolute;top:8px;right:8px;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font-size:.66rem;font-weight:800;border-radius:8px;padding:2px 8px;z-index:2}
.badge.pharma{background:var(--green)}
.card h3{margin:0;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.45;min-height:2.9em;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
.card-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;margin-top:auto}
.price{font-weight:900;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.1}
.price small{font-weight:700;font-size:.68rem;color:var(--muted)}
.price s{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;font-size:.72rem}
.add{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--brand);background:#fff;color:var(--brand);font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;transition:background .15s,color .15s}
.add:active,.add:hover{background:var(--brand);color:#fff}
.add:disabled{border-color:#ccc;color:#aaa;background:#f3f3f3;cursor:not-allowed;font-size:.7rem}
.step{display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--brand);border-radius:20px;color:#fff;flex:none}
.step button{width:32px;height:36px;border:0;background:none;color:#fff;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700}
.step output{min-width:20px;text-align:center;font-weight:800}
.empty{grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);padding:44px 16px}
.empty span{font-size:3rem;display:block}

/* ---------- Promo strips ---------- */
.strip{margin-top:22px;border-radius:18px;padding:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#1b1b1f,#3a3a45);color:#fff}
.strip .em{font-size:2.2rem}
.strip div{flex:1;line-height:1.4}
.strip b{display:block;font-size:1rem}
.strip small{opacity:.8}
.strip button{border:0;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font-weight:800;border-radius:20px;padding:9px 16px;white-space:nowrap}
.notice{margin-top:16px;background:var(--green-l);border:1px solid #b8ead2;color:#0b6b4a;border-radius:14px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.7}
footer{margin-top:30px;padding:20px 0 6px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.9}

/* ---------- Cart bar ---------- */
.cartbar{position:fixed;left:12px;right:12px;bottom:calc(12px + var(--safe-b));max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;z-index:90;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:18px;padding:13px 16px;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-weight:800;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(255,87,34,.45)}
.cartbar.show{display:flex;animation:up .3s}
@keyframes up{from{transform:translateY(30px);opacity:0}}
.cartbar .n{background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-radius:10px;padding:2px 10px}

/* ---------- Panels ---------- */
.overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(10,10,20,.55);z-index:150;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .25s,visibility 0s .25s}
.overlay.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transition-delay:0s}
.drawer,.sheet{position:fixed;background:#fff;z-index:200;visibility:hidden;transition:transform .3s,visibility 0s .3s}
.drawer.open,.sheet.open{visibility:visible;transform:none;transition-delay:0s}
.drawer{top:0;right:0;height:100%;width:min(94%,420px);transform:translateX(100%);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.sheet{left:0;right:0;bottom:0;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:22px 22px 0 0;padding:18px 18px calc(18px + var(--safe-b));transform:translateY(100%);max-height:90%;overflow-y:auto}
.ph{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.ph h2{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:900}
.close{border:0;background:none;font-size:1.8rem;line-height:1;color:var(--muted);padding:2px 10px}
.drawer .ph{padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.dbody{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:10px 16px 16px}
.dfoot{padding:12px 16px calc(14px + var(--safe-b));border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.free{background:var(--brand-l);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}
.free.done{background:var(--green-l);color:var(--green)}
.meter{height:8px;background:#fff;border-radius:6px;margin-top:8px;overflow:hidden}
.meter i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--brand),#ffb347);border-radius:6px;transition:width .4s}
.free.done .meter i{background:var(--green)}
.line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr auto;gap:4px 10px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.line .th{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.8rem;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.line .th img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;background:#fff}
.line .nm{font-weight:700;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.4}
.line .tt{font-weight:900;font-size:.92rem;white-space:nowrap}
.line .ctrl{grid-column:2/-1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted)}
.line .step button{height:30px;width:30px}
.link{border:0;background:none;color:#d62828;font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem;text-decoration:underline}
.link.n{color:var(--muted)}
.sp-line{margin:10px 0;padding:10px 12px;background:#fff7e6;border-right:4px solid #ffb020;border-radius:10px;font-size:.84rem}
.sp-line p{margin:4px 0 6px;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word}
.add-special{width:100%;margin-top:10px;border:2px dashed #d5d5df;background:none;border-radius:12px;padding:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted)}
.pharma-note{margin:10px 0;background:var(--green-l);color:#0b6b4a;border-radius:12px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.7}
.bill{background:#fafafa;border:1px dashed #d0d0d8;border-radius:14px;padding:12px;margin:12px 0}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:5px 0;font-size:.86rem}
.row.total{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:8px;margin-top:8px;font-weight:900;font-size:1rem;color:var(--brand-d)}
.row .ok{color:var(--green);font-weight:800}
.bn{font-size:.73rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0;line-height:1.6}
label.f{display:block;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;margin-top:10px}
input[type=text],input[type=tel],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:11px 12px;margin-top:4px;border:1.5px solid #dcdce4;border-radius:12px;background:#fff}
input:focus,textarea:focus,select:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--brand)}
textarea{resize:none}
.fixed-area{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--brand-l);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;font-weight:800;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:12px}
.fixed-area svg{color:var(--brand)}
.err{color:#d62828;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;min-height:1.2em;margin:8px 0 0}
.pay{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)}
.btn{width:100%;border:0;padding:14px;border-radius:14px;font-weight:900;font-size:1rem}
.btn.p{background:var(--brand);color:#fff}
.btn.p:disabled{background:#c9c9d2;cursor:not-allowed}
.btn.d{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;margin-top:10px}
.btn.g{background:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;padding:8px;margin-top:4px;font-weight:700}
.counter{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);text-align:left;margin-top:2px}
.sheet ol{padding-right:22px;line-height:2.1;margin:12px 0 0;font-weight:600}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:calc(90px + var(--safe-b));transform:translate(-50%,20px);background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:22px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.25s;z-index:300;max-width:90%;text-align:center}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
.skeleton{height:200px;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eee 25%,#f7f7f7 50%,#eee 75%);background-size:200% 100%;animation:sk 1.2s infinite}
@keyframes sk{to{background-position:-200% 0}}



/* ---------- Palestine banner (top of page) ---------- */
.pal{margin-top:14px;display:block;text-decoration:none;color:#fff;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.22);min-height:92px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0d0d0d 0 33.4%,#f2f2f2 33.4% 66.7%,#149954 66.7%)}
.pal::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(270deg,rgba(0,0,0,.82),rgba(0,0,0,.55) 55%,rgba(0,0,0,.15))}
.pal::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:24%;background:#e4312b;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 50%,0 100%)}
.pal .t{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:16px 18px;line-height:1.45;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.pal .fl{font-size:2.4rem;line-height:1;filter:drop-shadow(0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5))}
.pal b{display:block;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:900;text-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
.pal small{font-weight:700;font-size:.8rem;opacity:.95;text-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
.pal .go{margin-inline-start:auto;background:#fff;color:#0b6b3a;border-radius:18px;padding:5px 14px;font-weight:800;font-size:.8rem;white-space:nowrap;position:relative;z-index:1}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.pal .fl{animation:wave 3s ease-in-out infinite;transform-origin:70% 90%}@keyframes wave{50%{transform:rotate(-6deg)}}}
.palchip{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:2px solid #149954;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.35rem;text-decoration:none;flex:none}
@media(max-width:380px){.pal .go{display:none}}

/* ---------- Pledge ---------- */
.pledge{margin-top:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-decoration:none;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#101614,#1d2b26);border-radius:18px;padding:13px 14px;border:1px solid #2b3d36;box-shadow:var(--sh)}
.pledge .em{font-size:1.8rem}
.pledge div{flex:1;line-height:1.45}
.pledge b{display:block;font-size:.95rem}
.pledge small{opacity:.85;font-weight:600;font-size:.78rem}
.pledge .arr{font-size:1.4rem;opacity:.7}
.bmsg{margin-top:16px;background:#101614;color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:14px;line-height:1.7;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:600}
.bmsg b{color:#7fe3b5}
.bmsg a{color:#7fe3b5}

/* ---------- Install ---------- */
.install{margin-top:12px;border-radius:18px;padding:14px;display:none;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fff1ea,#ffe0d2);border:1px solid #ffd2bd}
.install.show{display:flex;animation:up .3s}
.install img{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;flex:none}
.install div{flex:1;line-height:1.4;min-width:0}
.install b{display:block;font-size:.95rem}
.install small{color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.install .go{border:0;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font-weight:800;border-radius:20px;padding:9px 16px;white-space:nowrap}
.install .x{border:0;background:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.4rem;line-height:1;padding:4px 6px}
.ios-steps li{margin-bottom:6px}
@media(min-width:720px){.slide{min-height:220px;padding:34px}.slide h2{font-size:2.1rem}.slide .art{font-size:8rem}.hrow .card{min-width:170px;max-width:170px}}

/* ---------- Customer Account, GPS & Notifications Modal & Widgets ---------- */
.auth-chip-btn{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:800;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.auth-chip-btn:hover{border-color:var(--brand);background:var(--brand-l)}
.bell-dot{position:absolute;top:2px;right:2px;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#ef4444;border:2px solid #fff}
.gps-box{background:#f0fdf4;border:1.5px dashed #86efac;border-radius:14px;padding:12px;margin:12px 0 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.gps-btn{width:100%;background:#15803d;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 12px;font-weight:800;font-size:0.85rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s}
.gps-btn:hover{background:#166534}
.gps-btn:disabled{background:#9ca3af;cursor:not-allowed}
.gps-status{font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:#166534;line-height:1.4}
.addr-tags{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:6px 0}
.addr-chip{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:16px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.addr-chip.selected{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink)}
.saved-addr-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
.saved-addr-card{background:#fafafa;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:0.82rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s}
.saved-addr-card:hover{border-color:var(--brand)}
.auth-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:14px}
.auth-tab{flex:1;background:none;border:none;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;padding:10px;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
.auth-tab.active{color:var(--brand);border-bottom-color:var(--brand)}
.offer-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-right:5px solid var(--brand);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
.offer-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px}
.offer-badge{background:#ffedd5;color:#c2410c;font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:800;border-radius:6px;padding:2px 8px}
.offer-title{font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);margin:0}
.offer-desc{font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 0;line-height:1.4}

/* ---------- Professional Firebase Account UI ---------- */
.auth-security-note{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #dbe4ee;border-radius:12px;padding:9px 11px;margin:12px 0;font-size:.76rem;color:#334155;line-height:1.55}
.password-hint{background:#f8faf9;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;margin:-3px 0 10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5}
.auth-submit-wide{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:44px}
.btn:disabled,.auth-submit-wide:disabled{opacity:.65;cursor:not-allowed}

/* ================= ALAZHAR CITY V15 VISUAL SYSTEM ================= */
:root{--v15-red:#e63127;--v15-red2:#b91f19;--v15-black:#0d1210;--v15-white:#fff;--v15-soft:#f7f8f6}
.v15-brand-mark{position:relative;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--v15-black);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(13,18,16,.18)}
.v15-brand-mark img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.v15-brand-mark::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:1px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:13px;pointer-events:none}
.v15-icon-btn{position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:visible}
.v15-icon-btn::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-3px;border:1px solid rgba(230,49,39,.0);border-radius:17px;transition:.25s ease;z-index:-1}
.v15-icon-btn:hover::before{border-color:rgba(230,49,39,.25);transform:scale(1.08)}
.v15-icon{width:20px;height:20px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.v15-track{font-size:0!important}
.v15-track .v15-icon{width:21px;height:21px}
.v15-login-link{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#171d1a,#080b0a)!important;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)!important}
.v15-login-link .v15-icon{transition:transform .3s ease}
.v15-login-link:hover .v15-icon{transform:translateY(-1px) rotate(-4deg)}
.v15-brand-hero{position:relative;margin:16px 0 0;padding:18px;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b100e 0%,#171f1b 60%,#252d29 100%);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(13,18,16,.18);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:112px}
.v15-brand-hero::before,.v15-brand-hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none}
.v15-brand-hero::before{width:180px;height:180px;left:-95px;bottom:-120px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
.v15-brand-hero::after{width:260px;height:260px;right:-180px;top:-190px;background:rgba(230,49,39,.12)}
.v15-brand-hero-art{position:relative;z-index:1;width:82px;height:82px;border-radius:22px;background:#000;flex:none;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.28);animation:v15Float 4s ease-in-out infinite}
.v15-brand-hero-art img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.v15-brand-hero-copy{position:relative;z-index:1;min-width:0}
.v15-brand-hero-kicker{display:block;color:#ff7c73;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:3px}
.v15-brand-hero h2{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:1.18rem;font-weight:900;line-height:1.4}
.v15-brand-hero p{margin:0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.7;font-weight:600}
.v15-brand-hero-line{height:2px;width:58px;background:var(--v15-red);border-radius:99px;margin-top:9px;animation:v15Line 2.2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes v15Float{50%{transform:translateY(-5px) rotate(-1deg)}}
@keyframes v15Line{50%{width:88px;opacity:.65}}
.v15-section-reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
.v15-section-reveal.v15-visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
.v15-card-motion{transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),box-shadow .25s ease}
.v15-card-motion:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 34px rgba(20,35,29,.11)}
.v15-pulse-dot{position:absolute;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(230,49,39,.5);animation:v15Pulse 1.8s infinite}
@keyframes v15Pulse{70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(230,49,39,0)}}
.v15-login-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;text-decoration:none!important}
@media(max-width:560px){.v15-brand-hero{padding:14px;min-height:100px}.v15-brand-hero-art{width:68px;height:68px;border-radius:18px}.v15-brand-hero h2{font-size:1.02rem}.v15-brand-hero p{font-size:.72rem}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.v15-brand-hero-art,.v15-brand-hero-line,.v15-section-reveal{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}

</style>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./src/pro-theme.css">
<style>
.featured-offers-top{margin-top:16px;padding:14px 0 2px}.featured-offers-top .section-kicker{margin:2px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.74rem;font-weight:600}.featured-offers-top .empty{padding:18px 10px;width:100%;background:#fff;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:14px}.intro-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:600;background:rgba(8,18,14,.72);padding:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;backdrop-filter:blur(0px);transition:opacity .38s ease,backdrop-filter .38s ease,visibility 0s linear .38s}.intro-overlay.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);transition:opacity .38s ease,backdrop-filter .38s ease,visibility 0s linear 0s}.intro-card{width:min(560px,100%);background:#fff;border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.28);transform:scale(.9) translateY(18px);opacity:0;transition:transform .42s cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.32,1.1),opacity .3s ease}.intro-overlay.open .intro-card{transform:scale(1) translateY(0);opacity:1}.intro-progress{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:14px 18px 0}.intro-progress i{height:4px;flex:1;border-radius:99px;background:#e5ebe7;transition:background .35s ease,transform .25s ease}.intro-progress i.active{background:var(--brand)}.intro-progress i.current{transform:scaleY(1.6)}.intro-page{display:none;padding:26px 22px 20px;min-height:360px;overflow:hidden}.intro-page.active{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.intro-page.active[data-dir="fwd"]{animation:introFwd .48s cubic-bezier(.22,.75,.32,1) both}.intro-page.active[data-dir="back"]{animation:introBack .48s cubic-bezier(.22,.75,.32,1) both}@keyframes introFwd{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-26px) scale(.97)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0) scale(1)}}@keyframes introBack{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(26px) scale(.97)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0) scale(1)}}.intro-emoji{font-size:4.2rem;text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px;display:inline-block}.intro-page.active .intro-emoji{animation:introPop .55s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) both}@keyframes introPop{0%{opacity:0;transform:scale(.35) rotate(-10deg)}55%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.15) rotate(4deg)}100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1) rotate(0)}}.intro-page h2{margin:0 0 10px;text-align:center;font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:900}.intro-page.active h2{animation:introFadeUp .4s ease both;animation-delay:.08s}.intro-page p{margin:0 auto;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;text-align:center;max-width:440px;font-size:.92rem}.intro-page.active>p{animation:introFadeUp .4s ease both;animation-delay:.14s}@keyframes introFadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}.intro-points{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:18px 0}.intro-point{background:#f8faf8;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:11px 13px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;opacity:0}.intro-page.active .intro-point{animation:introFadeUp .4s ease both}.intro-page.active .intro-point:nth-child(1){animation-delay:.2s}.intro-page.active .intro-point:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.27s}.intro-page.active .intro-point:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.34s}.intro-page.active .intro-point:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.41s}.intro-page.active .intro-note{opacity:0;animation:introFadeUp .4s ease both;animation-delay:.48s}.intro-pager{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:14px 18px 18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.intro-btn{border:0;border-radius:14px;padding:11px 18px;font-weight:900;transition:transform .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease}.intro-btn:active{transform:scale(.94)}.intro-btn.primary{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(233,75,60,.32)}.intro-btn.secondary{background:#f1f5f2;color:var(--ink)}.intro-skip{border:0;background:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;text-align:right;transition:opacity .15s}.intro-skip:active{opacity:.6}.intro-note{font-size:.73rem!important;margin-top:12px!important}@media(max-width:520px){.intro-page{min-height:390px}.intro-page h2{font-size:1.25rem}.intro-pager{grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;padding-inline:14px}}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.intro-overlay,.intro-card,.intro-page.active,.intro-page.active *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}</style>

<style id="scrollTourCSS">
/* ================== Dynamic Scroll Tour ================== */
.scroll-tour{
  position:fixed;
  inset:0;
  z-index:580;
  pointer-events:none;
  display:none;
}
.scroll-tour.active{display:block}

.scroll-tour-dim{
  position:fixed;
  inset:0;
  background:rgba(4,12,9,.34);
  backdrop-filter:blur(1.5px);
  transition:opacity .25s ease;
}

.scroll-tour-card{
  position:fixed;
  z-index:3;
  width:min(330px,calc(100vw - 28px));
  background:#fff;
  border:1px solid rgba(20,35,29,.08);
  border-radius:20px;
  padding:14px 15px;
  box-shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.24);
  direction:rtl;
  pointer-events:auto;
  transform:translateY(10px) scale(.96);
  opacity:0;
  transition:
    transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),
    opacity .25s ease,
    left .3s ease,
    top .3s ease;
}

.scroll-tour-card.show{
  transform:translateY(0) scale(1);
  opacity:1;
}

.scroll-tour-head{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:9px;
  margin-bottom:6px;
}

.scroll-tour-icon{
  width:38px;
  height:38px;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  border-radius:13px;
  background:#fff4f2;
  font-size:20px;
  flex:none;
}

.scroll-tour-title{
  margin:0;
  font-size:.92rem;
  font-weight:900;
  color:var(--ink);
}

.scroll-tour-text{
  margin:0;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.77rem;
  line-height:1.65;
}

.scroll-tour-progress{
  display:flex;
  gap:4px;
  margin-top:11px;
}

.scroll-tour-progress i{
  height:3px;
  flex:1;
  border-radius:99px;
  background:#e5ebe7;
  transition:.3s;
}

.scroll-tour-progress i.active{
  background:var(--brand);
}

.scroll-tour-close{
  position:absolute;
  top:8px;
  left:9px;
  border:0;
  background:transparent;
  color:#87938d;
  font-size:19px;
  cursor:pointer;
  line-height:1;
}

.scroll-tour-arrow{
  position:fixed;
  z-index:4;
  width:48px;
  height:48px;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  border-radius:50%;
  background:#fff;
  color:var(--brand);
  font-size:25px;
  box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
  opacity:0;
  transform:scale(.65);
  transition:
    opacity .25s ease,
    transform .3s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),
    left .3s ease,
    top .3s ease;
}

.scroll-tour-arrow.show{
  opacity:1;
  transform:scale(1);
  animation:tourArrowFloat 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes tourArrowFloat{
  0%,100%{translate:0 0}
  50%{translate:0 7px}
}

/* العنصر اللي الجولة بتشرحه */
.scroll-tour-target{
  position:relative!important;
  z-index:581!important;
  border-radius:16px!important;
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 4px rgba(233,75,60,.25),
    0 0 0 9999px rgba(4,12,9,.22),
    0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.16)!important;
  transition:box-shadow .3s ease!important;
}

/* لو الهدف زر في الهيدر */
.scroll-tour-target.icon-btn{
  border-radius:14px!important;
}

@media(max-width:520px){
  .scroll-tour-card{
    bottom:18px;
    left:14px!important;
    right:14px;
    width:auto;
  }

  .scroll-tour-arrow{
    width:43px;
    height:43px;
    font-size:22px;
  }
}

@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .scroll-tour-card,
  .scroll-tour-arrow{
    transition:none;
  }
  .scroll-tour-arrow.show{
    animation:none;
  }
}
</style>

<!-- AMH_SCROLL_TOUR_START -->

<!-- AMH_SCROLL_TOUR_START -->

<style id="amhScrollTourCSS">

/* ============================================================
   AMH PROFESSIONAL SCROLL ONBOARDING
   ============================================================ */

:root{
  --tour-brand:#e94b3c;
  --tour-brand-dark:#bd3027;
  --tour-green:#0a8150;
  --tour-ink:#14231d;
  --tour-muted:#65746d;
  --tour-glass:rgba(255,255,255,.92);
}

/* ---------- Main layer ---------- */

.amh-scroll-tour{
  position:fixed;
  inset:0;
  z-index:99990;
  pointer-events:none;
  opacity:0;
  visibility:hidden;
  transition:
    opacity .35s ease,
    visibility .35s ease;
  direction:rtl;
}

.amh-scroll-tour.is-active{
  opacity:1;
  visibility:visible;
}

/* ---------- Background ---------- */

.amh-tour-backdrop{
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(
      circle at 50% 45%,
      rgba(255,255,255,.04),
      rgba(3,12,9,.48)
    );
  backdrop-filter:blur(1.5px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(1.5px);
}

/* ---------- Spotlight ---------- */

.amh-tour-spotlight{
  position:fixed;
  z-index:99991;
  pointer-events:none;
  border-radius:18px;

  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.92),
    0 0 0 5px rgba(233,75,60,.34),
    0 0 0 100vmax rgba(3,12,9,.42),
    0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.28);

  opacity:0;

  transition:
    left .42s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),
    top .42s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),
    width .42s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),
    height .42s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),
    border-radius .3s ease,
    opacity .25s ease;
}

.amh-scroll-tour.is-active .amh-tour-spotlight{
  opacity:1;
}

/* ---------- Animated pulse around target ---------- */

.amh-tour-pulse{
  position:absolute;
  inset:-7px;
  border-radius:inherit;
  border:2px solid rgba(233,75,60,.45);
  animation:amhTourPulse 1.7s ease-out infinite;
}

@keyframes amhTourPulse{
  0%{
    transform:scale(.96);
    opacity:.9;
  }
  70%{
    transform:scale(1.08);
    opacity:0;
  }
  100%{
    transform:scale(1.08);
    opacity:0;
  }
}

/* ---------- Main information card ---------- */

.amh-tour-card{
  position:fixed;
  z-index:99994;

  width:min(390px,calc(100vw - 28px));

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      145deg,
      rgba(255,255,255,.98),
      rgba(248,251,249,.95)
    );

  border:1px solid rgba(20,35,29,.09);
  border-radius:24px;

  padding:17px 17px 15px;

  box-shadow:
    0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.28),
    0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.12);

  transform:
    translateY(18px)
    scale(.94);

  opacity:0;

  transition:
    left .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),
    top .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),
    transform .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),
    opacity .3s ease;
}

.amh-tour-card.show{
  opacity:1;
  transform:translateY(0) scale(1);
}

/* ---------- Card top ---------- */

.amh-tour-top{
  display:flex;
  align-items:flex-start;
  gap:11px;
}

.amh-tour-icon{
  width:46px;
  height:46px;
  min-width:46px;

  display:grid;
  place-items:center;

  border-radius:15px;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      #fff0ed,
      #fff8f7
    );

  border:1px solid rgba(233,75,60,.12);

  font-size:22px;

  box-shadow:
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9);
}

.amh-tour-heading{
  min-width:0;
  flex:1;
  padding-left:23px;
}

.amh-tour-step{
  display:block;
  color:var(--tour-brand);
  font-size:10px;
  font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:.5px;
  margin-bottom:3px;
}

.amh-tour-title{
  margin:0;
  color:var(--tour-ink);
  font-size:15px;
  line-height:1.35;
  font-weight:950;
}

.amh-tour-close{
  position:absolute;
  top:10px;
  left:11px;

  width:27px;
  height:27px;

  border:0;
  border-radius:50%;

  display:grid;
  place-items:center;

  background:#f1f4f2;
  color:#68756f;

  cursor:pointer;

  font-size:17px;
  line-height:1;

  transition:
    background .2s ease,
    transform .2s ease;
}

.amh-tour-close:hover{
  background:#e8ece9;
  transform:rotate(8deg);
}

/* ---------- Description ---------- */

.amh-tour-description{
  margin:10px 0 12px;

  color:var(--tour-muted);

  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.75;
}

/* ---------- Bottom controls ---------- */

.amh-tour-bottom{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:10px;
}

.amh-tour-progress{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:4px;
  flex:1;
}

.amh-tour-dot{
  height:4px;
  flex:1;
  border-radius:99px;
  background:#e1e8e4;

  transition:
    background .3s ease,
    transform .3s ease;
}

.amh-tour-dot.active{
  background:var(--tour-brand);
  transform:scaleY(1.35);
}

.amh-tour-counter{
  color:#84918b;
  font-size:10px;
  font-weight:800;
  white-space:nowrap;
}

/* ---------- Scroll hint ---------- */

.amh-tour-scroll-hint{
  position:fixed;
  z-index:99993;

  left:50%;
  bottom:18px;

  transform:
    translateX(-50%)
    translateY(10px);

  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:7px;

  padding:8px 13px;

  background:rgba(20,35,29,.88);
  color:#fff;

  border-radius:999px;

  font-size:10px;
  font-weight:800;

  box-shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.22);

  opacity:0;

  transition:
    opacity .3s ease,
    transform .3s ease;
}

.amh-tour-scroll-hint.show{
  opacity:1;
  transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
}

.amh-tour-scroll-icon{
  display:inline-block;
  animation:
    amhScrollFinger 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes amhScrollFinger{
  0%,100%{
    transform:translateY(-2px);
  }
  50%{
    transform:translateY(4px);
  }
}

/* ---------- Arrow ---------- */

.amh-tour-arrow{
  position:fixed;
  z-index:99993;

  width:52px;
  height:52px;

  display:grid;
  place-items:center;

  border-radius:50%;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      145deg,
      #ffffff,
      #f8faf9
    );

  color:var(--tour-brand);

  border:2px solid rgba(233,75,60,.16);

  box-shadow:
    0 14px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.22),
    0 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,.18);

  font-size:24px;
  font-weight:900;

  opacity:0;

  transform:scale(.65);

  transition:
    left .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),
    top .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),
    opacity .25s ease,
    transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
}

.amh-tour-arrow.show{
  opacity:1;
  transform:scale(1);

  animation:
    amhArrowFloat 1.25s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes amhArrowFloat{
  0%,100%{
    margin-top:0;
  }
  50%{
    margin-top:8px;
  }
}

/* ---------- Target animation ---------- */

.amh-tour-target{
  position:relative!important;
  z-index:99992!important;

  transition:
    transform .3s ease,
    box-shadow .3s ease!important;
}

.amh-tour-target:hover{
  transform:translateY(-1px);
}

/* ---------- Tiny label attached to target ---------- */

.amh-tour-label{
  position:fixed;
  z-index:99995;

  padding:6px 9px;

  background:var(--tour-brand);
  color:#fff;

  border-radius:8px;

  font-size:9px;
  font-weight:900;

  white-space:nowrap;

  box-shadow:0 7px 20px rgba(233,75,60,.28);

  opacity:0;

  transform:translateY(5px);

  transition:
    opacity .25s ease,
    transform .25s ease;
}

.amh-tour-label.show{
  opacity:1;
  transform:translateY(0);
}

/* ---------- Completion ---------- */

.amh-tour-complete{
  position:fixed;
  inset:0;
  z-index:100000;

  display:grid;
  place-items:center;

  background:
    radial-gradient(
      circle at center,
      rgba(10,129,80,.18),
      rgba(3,12,9,.72)
    );

  opacity:0;
  visibility:hidden;

  transition:
    opacity .35s ease,
    visibility .35s ease;
}

.amh-tour-complete.show{
  opacity:1;
  visibility:visible;
}

.amh-tour-complete-box{
  width:min(380px,calc(100vw - 30px));

  padding:28px 22px;

  text-align:center;

  background:#fff;
  border-radius:28px;

  box-shadow:0 30px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.32);

  transform:scale(.9);
  transition:transform .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
}

.amh-tour-complete.show .amh-tour-complete-box{
  transform:scale(1);
}

.amh-tour-complete-icon{
  width:68px;
  height:68px;

  margin:0 auto 12px;

  display:grid;
  place-items:center;

  border-radius:22px;

  background:#e9f7f0;

  font-size:31px;

  animation:
    amhCompletePop .55s cubic-bezier(.2,1.5,.4,1);
}

@keyframes amhCompletePop{
  0%{transform:scale(.4);opacity:0}
  100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1}
}

.amh-tour-complete h3{
  margin:0 0 7px;
  color:var(--tour-ink);
  font-size:18px;
  font-weight:950;
}

.amh-tour-complete p{
  margin:0;
  color:var(--tour-muted);
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.7;
}

.amh-tour-complete button{
  margin-top:17px;

  border:0;
  border-radius:13px;

  padding:11px 20px;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      var(--tour-brand),
      var(--tour-brand-dark)
    );

  color:#fff;

  font-weight:900;
  font-size:12px;

  cursor:pointer;

  box-shadow:
    0 8px 22px rgba(233,75,60,.25);
}

/* ---------- Mobile ---------- */

@media(max-width:600px){

  .amh-tour-card{
    left:14px!important;
    right:14px!important;
    bottom:15px!important;
    top:auto!important;

    width:auto;

    border-radius:22px;

    padding:15px 15px 13px;
  }

  .amh-tour-arrow{
    width:44px;
    height:44px;
    font-size:21px;
  }

  .amh-tour-scroll-hint{
    bottom:165px;
  }

  .amh-tour-label{
    display:none;
  }
}

/* ---------- Reduced motion ---------- */

@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){

  .amh-tour-arrow.show,
  .amh-tour-scroll-icon,
  .amh-tour-pulse,
  .amh-tour-complete-icon{
    animation:none!important;
  }

  .amh-tour-card,
  .amh-tour-arrow,
  .amh-tour-spotlight,
  .amh-tour-label{
    transition:none!important;
  }
}

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="top">
  <div class="flagbar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="bar">
      <img class="logo" src="./images/logo.webp" alt="شعار Alazhar City Delivery" width="46" height="46">
      <div class="loc">
        <small id="audience">التوصيل إلى</small>
        <b><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.8-7 11-7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></svg><span id="areaName"></span></b>
      </div>
      <span class="status" id="status"></span>
      <a class="palchip" href="./palestine.html" aria-label="مع فلسطين" title="مع فلسطين">🇵🇸</a>
      <button class="icon-btn v15-icon-btn" id="openNotificationsBtn" aria-label="العروض والإشعارات اليومية" title="العروض والإشعارات اليومية" style="position:relative">
        <svg class="v15-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 7-3 9h18c0-2-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M10 21h4"/></svg>
        <span class="bell-dot" id="notifBadge" style="display:block"></span>
      </button>
      <button class="icon-btn v15-icon-btn v15-login-link" id="openAccountBtn" aria-label="تسجيل الدخول أو فتح الحساب" title="تسجيل الدخول / حسابي" style="position:relative">
        <svg class="v15-icon" id="userIcon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M5 20c.8-3.6 3.1-5.5 7-5.5s6.2 1.9 7 5.5"/></svg>
      </button>
      <a class="icon-btn v15-icon-btn v15-track" href="./track.html" aria-label="تتبع الطلب وتقييم الخدمة" title="تتبع طلباتك وسجل الطلبات" style="text-decoration:none;display:grid;place-items:center">
        <svg class="v15-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v10H3z"/><path d="M14 10h4l3 3v4h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="2"/></svg>
      </a>
      <button class="icon-btn download-btn" id="topInstallBtn" aria-label="تنزيل التطبيق" title="تنزيل التطبيق (أندرويد / آيفون)">
        <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
      </button>
      <button class="icon-btn" id="openCart" aria-label="فتح السلة">
        <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"/><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/></svg>
        <span class="cnt" id="cartCount">0</span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <label class="search" id="searchBox">
      <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
      <span class="sr-only">ابحث عن منتج</span>
      <input type="search" id="search" placeholder="بتدور على إيه؟ اكتب اسم المنتج أو الدوا أو المشروب..." autocomplete="off" enterkeyhint="search">
      <button type="button" id="clearSearch" aria-label="مسح البحث">&times;</button>
    </label>
    <div class="tabs" role="group" aria-label="نوع المتجر">
      <button class="tab" data-group="all" aria-pressed="true"><svg class="v15-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6h18l-2 14H5L3 6z"/><path d="M8 6a4 4 0 0 1 8 0"/></svg> الكل</button>
      <button class="tab" data-group="market" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="v15-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5h2l2 11h10l2-8H6"/><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1.5"/><circle cx="17" cy="20" r="1.5"/></svg> سوبرماركت</button>
      <button class="tab" data-group="pharmacy" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="v15-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3h8v18H8z"/><path d="M5 8h14v8H5z"/></svg> صيدلية</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<main class="wrap" id="main">
  <div class="install" id="installBox" role="region" aria-label="تثبيت التطبيق">
    <img src="icons/icon-192.png" alt="" width="48" height="48">
    <div><b>خلي الطلب أسرع على موبايلك</b><small>خلي الموقع قريب منك من غير ما تفتح المتصفح كل مرة · <a href="./install.html" style="color:var(--brand-d);font-weight:700">الخطوات</a></small></div>
    <button class="go" id="installBtn">تحميل</button>
    <button class="x" id="installClose" aria-label="إخفاء">&times;</button>
  </div>

  <section class="v15-brand-hero v15-section-reveal" aria-label="Alazhar City Delivery">
    <div class="v15-brand-hero-art"><img src="./images/logo.webp" alt="Alazhar City Delivery" width="82" height="82"></div>
    <div class="v15-brand-hero-copy">
      <span class="v15-brand-hero-kicker">ALAZHAR CITY DELIVERY</span>
      <h2>من طلبك لحد بابك — أسرع وأوضح.</h2>
      <p>سوبرماركت وصيدلية للحي السادس، بواجهة بسيطة وحركة خفيفة تخليك تركز على طلبك.</p>
      <div class="v15-brand-hero-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <a class="pal" id="palBanner" href="./palestine.html">
    <div class="t">
      <span class="fl" aria-hidden="true">🇵🇸</span>
      <div><b>مع فلسطين</b><small>ملتزمون بالمقاطعة — موقفنا بأفعال مش شعارات</small></div>
      <span class="go">اعرف أكتر ‹</span>
    </div>
  </a>

  <section class="sec featured-offers-top" id="featuredOffers" aria-label="عروض اليوم">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div><h2>🔥 عروض اليوم</h2><p class="section-kicker">خصومات بننزلها أول بأول علشان تلاقي الحاجة الحلوة من غير لف كتير.</p></div>
      <button class="more" id="featuredOffersMore" type="button">شوف الكل ‹</button>
    </div>
    <div class="hrow" id="featuredOffersRow"><div class="empty">بنجهّز لك العروض…</div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="hero v15-card-motion v15-section-reveal" id="hero" aria-label="عروض">
    <div class="slides" id="slides"></div>
    <div class="dots" id="dots"></div>
  </section>



  <div class="usp v15-section-reveal">
    <div><span>⚡</span>توصيل في <span id="eta" style="display:inline;font-size:inherit"></span></div>
    <div><span>💵</span>الدفع عند الاستلام</div>
    <div><span>🎓</span>أسعار تناسب الطلبة</div>
  </div>

  <a class="pledge" href="./boycott.html">
    <span class="em">🕊️</span>
    <div><b>مش بنبيع ومش بنوصّل منتجات مقاطعة</b><small>شوف قائمة الشركات ومصادرها</small></div>
    <span class="arr">‹</span>
  </a>

  <section class="home-intro" aria-label="عن الخدمة"><div><span>لطلبة الأزهر في الحي السادس</span><h1>طلبك من مكان واحد، لحد باب سكنك.</h1><p>سوبرماركت وصيدلية، أسعار واضحة، وتوصيل بسيط من أول الطلب لحد الاستلام.</p></div><div class="home-intro-actions"><a href="#catSec">ابدأ اختيارك</a><a class="secondary" href="./track.html">تابع طلبك</a></div></section>

  <section class="sec v15-section-reveal" id="catSec">
    <div class="sec-head"><div><h2>🛍️ اختار اللي محتاجه</h2><p class="section-kicker">كل حاجة متقسمة علشان توصل للي بتدور عليه أسرع.</p></div></div>
    <div class="tiles" id="tiles"></div>
  </section>

  <div id="content"><div class="grid"><div class="skeleton"></div><div class="skeleton"></div><div class="skeleton"></div></div></div>

  <div class="strip">
    <span class="em">📝</span>
    <div><b>مش لاقي اللي عايزه؟</b><small>اكتب طلبك وهنوفره لك ونكلمك بالسعر</small></div>
    <button id="openSpecial">طلب خاص</button>
  </div>

  <p class="notice">💊 <b>تنبيه الصيدلية:</b> بنوفر المنتجات والأدوية اللي تُصرف بدون روشتة فقط. أي دوا بيتأكد مع الصيدلي قبل التسليم، والاستشارة الطبية مش بديل عن الدكتور. لو الأعراض شديدة أو مستمرة اتواصل مع طبيب.</p>

  <footer>
    <div><b id="brandName"></b> — <span id="footArea"></span></div>
    <div>مواعيد العمل: <span id="hours"></span> · <button class="link n" id="openHelp">إزاي تطلب؟</button> · <a href="./track.html" style="color:var(--brand-d);font-weight:700">Location متابعة طلبي</a> · <a href="./install.html" style="color:var(--brand-d);font-weight:700">📲 تنزيل التطبيق</a> · <a href="./palestine.html" style="color:var(--brand-d);font-weight:700">🇵🇸 مع فلسطين</a> · <a href="./boycott.html" style="color:var(--brand-d);font-weight:700">🕊️ سياسة المقاطعة</a></div>
  </footer>
</main>

<button class="cartbar" id="cartBar" aria-label="عرض السلة">
  <span class="n" id="barCount">0</span>
  <span>عرض السلة</span>
  <span id="barTotal">0 ج.م</span>
</button>

<div class="intro-overlay" id="firstLaunchIntro" aria-modal="true" role="dialog" aria-label="جولة البداية">
  <div class="intro-card">
    <div class="intro-progress" id="introProgress"><i class="active"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    <section class="intro-page active"><div class="intro-emoji">🎓</div><h2>اتعمل مخصوص لطلاب الأزهر</h2><p>كل اللي تحتاجه في الحي السادس بمدينة نصر من مكان واحد — أسعار واضحة وتوصيل لحد باب السكن.</p><div class="intro-points"><div class="intro-point">Location تركيزنا على مساكن طلبة الأزهر واللي حواليها</div><div class="intro-point">🛒 سوبرماركت + 💊 صيدلية في نفس التجربة</div><div class="intro-point">⚡ طلب بسيط وتوصيل مباشر</div></div></section>
    <section class="intro-page"><div class="intro-emoji">🧭</div><h2>اطلبها في كام خطوة وخلاص</h2><p>اختار اللي محتاجه، راجع السلة، حدد مكانك، وإحنا نتابع الطلب معاك لحد ما يوصلك.</p><div class="intro-points"><div class="intro-point">1️⃣ اختار المنتجات أو اطلب طلب خاص</div><div class="intro-point">2️⃣ حدد عنوان السكن أو GPS</div><div class="intro-point">3️⃣ تابع حالة الطلب لحظة بلحظة</div></div></section>
    <section class="intro-page"><div class="intro-emoji">🇵🇸</div><h2>مع فلسطين</h2><p>عندنا صفحة مخصصة تشرح سياسة الدعم والمقاطعة والمصادر اللي تعتمد عليها المنصة.</p><div class="intro-points"><div class="intro-point">🕊️ علم فلسطين هيفضل ظاهر فوق</div><div class="intro-point">📖 اضغط عليه في أي وقت لقراءة التفاصيل</div><div class="intro-point">↗️ صفحة فلسطين + سياسة المقاطعة</div></div></section>
    <section class="intro-page"><div class="intro-emoji">📲</div><h2>نزّل التطبيق المناسب ليك</h2><p>كل دور له تطبيق مستقل، والرابط اللي فتحته هو اللي بيحدد التطبيق:</p><div class="intro-points"><div class="intro-point">🛍️ العميل → Alazhar City</div><div class="intro-point">🛵 المندوب → Alazhar City Rider</div><div class="intro-point">🏪 المتجر → Alazhar City Store</div><div class="intro-point">🧭 الإدارة → Alazhar Admin</div></div><p class="intro-note">بعد التثبيت مش هنعيد الجولة دي عليك.</p></section>
    <div class="intro-pager"><button class="intro-skip" id="introSkip" type="button">مش دلوقتي</button><button class="intro-btn secondary" id="introPrev" type="button" hidden>رجوع</button><button class="intro-btn primary" id="introNext" type="button">التالي</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ================== Dynamic Scroll Tour ================== -->
<div class="scroll-tour" id="scrollTour" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="scroll-tour-dim"></div>

  <div class="scroll-tour-arrow" id="scrollTourArrow">
    ↓
  </div>

  <div class="scroll-tour-card" id="scrollTourCard">
    <button class="scroll-tour-close" id="scrollTourClose" type="button" aria-label="إغلاق الجولة">&times;</button>

    <div class="scroll-tour-head">
      <div class="scroll-tour-icon" id="scrollTourIcon">👋</div>
      <h3 class="scroll-tour-title" id="scrollTourTitle">أهلاً بيك</h3>
    </div>

    <p class="scroll-tour-text" id="scrollTourText"></p>

    <div class="scroll-tour-progress" id="scrollTourProgress">
      <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="overlay" id="overlay"></div>

<!-- Cart -->
<aside class="drawer" id="cartPanel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cartTitle">
  <div class="ph"><h2 id="cartTitle">🛒 سلة الطلبات</h2><button class="close" data-close aria-label="إغلاق">&times;</button></div>
  <div class="dbody">
    <div class="free" id="free"></div>
    <div id="cartItems"></div>
    <button class="add-special" id="addSpecialBtn">＋ إضافة طلب خاص</button>
    <div class="pharma-note" id="pharmaNote" hidden>💊 المنتجات الصيدلانية هتتأكد مع الصيدلي قبل التسليم.</div>
    <div class="bill">
      <div class="row"><span>ثمن المنتجات</span><span><b id="itemsTotal">0</b> ج.م</span></div>
      <div class="row"><span>التوصيل</span><span id="deliveryFee"></span></div>
      <div class="row total"><span>الإجمالي</span><span><b id="finalTotal">0</b> ج.م</span></div>
      <p class="bn" id="billNote" hidden>الأصناف اللي سعرها بالتأكيد (الطلب الخاص) هتتضاف على الإجمالي بعد ما نكلمك.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fixed-area"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.8-7 11-7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></svg><span id="areaFixed"></span></div>
    
    <!-- GPS Location Fast Detect Box -->
    <div class="gps-box" style="background:#f0fdf4;border:1.5px solid #86efac;border-radius:14px;padding:12px;margin:12px 0 10px">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
        <b style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#166534">Location تحديد موقع التوصيل بـ GPS وقت الطلب</b>
        <span id="savedAddressBadge" style="font-size:0.7rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:800">نفس سيستم طلبات</span>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:0.76rem;color:#166534;margin:4px 0 8px;line-height:1.4">
        هنحدد موقع سكنك تلقائياً بالقمر الصناعي (GPS) وقت إرسال الطلب وهيتسجل في حسابك باسم <b>السكن</b> بدون ما تحتاج تكتب عنوان!
      </p>

      <!-- Location Mode Toggle -->
      <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <label id="lblGpsOption" style="flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #16a34a;border-radius:10px;padding:8px;font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:800;color:#166534;cursor:pointer">
          <input type="radio" name="orderLocType" id="locTypeGps" value="gps" checked style="accent-color:#16a34a">
          <span>🎯 تحديد موقعي بـ GPS وقت الطلب</span>
        </label>
        <label id="lblManualOption" style="flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#f9fafb;border:1.5px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:10px;padding:8px;font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer">
          <input type="radio" name="orderLocType" id="locTypeManual" value="manual" style="accent-color:#16a34a">
          <span>✍️ كتابة يدوية</span>
        </label>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Address Label Select (السكن، الكلية، المكتب) -->
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:4px">
        <span style="font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:#166534">تسجيل الموقع في حسابك باسم:</span>
        <span id="cartCurrentLabelDisplay" style="font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:800;color:#15803d">🏠 السكن</span>
      </div>
      <div class="addr-tags" id="cartAddrTags">
        <button type="button" class="addr-chip selected" data-label="السكن">🏠 السكن</button>
        <button type="button" class="addr-chip" data-label="سكن الطلبة">🎓 سكن الطلبة</button>
        <button type="button" class="addr-chip" data-label="المدينة الجامعية">🏢 المدينة الجامعية</button>
        <button type="button" class="addr-chip" data-label="العمل"> العمل</button>
      </div>

      <div class="gps-status" id="cartGpsStatus" style="font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;color:#15803d;margin-top:6px;background:#dcfce7;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px">
        ⚡ جاهز: اضغط زر «إرسال الطلب» تحت، وهيلتقط موقع السكن بـ GPS فوراً ويبعت لوكيشن الخريطة للدليفري!
      </div>
    </div>

    <label class="f">الاسم بالكامل<input type="text" id="clientName" autocomplete="name" maxlength="60" placeholder="اسمك"></label>
    <label class="f">رقم الموبايل<input type="tel" id="clientPhone" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="15" placeholder="01xxxxxxxxx" dir="ltr" style="text-align:right"></label>
    <div id="manualAddressWrapper" style="display:none">
      <label class="f">العنوان بالتفصيل (العمارة / الشارع / علامة مميزة)<input type="text" id="clientLocation" autocomplete="street-address" maxlength="150" placeholder="مثال: الحي السادس، شارع الطيران عمارة 5"></label>
    </div>
    <label class="f">ملاحظات للمندوب (رقم الشقة / الدور - اختياري)<input type="text" id="clientNote" maxlength="100" placeholder="مثال: الدور الرابع، شقة 12، رن الجرس"></label>
    <div class="pay">💵 الدفع كاش عند الاستلام</div>
    <p class="err" id="formError" role="alert"></p>
  </div>
  <div class="dfoot">
    <button class="btn p" id="sendOrder" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;font-size:0.96rem;padding:14px">
      <span id="sendOrderBtnIcon">🛵</span>
      <span id="sendOrderBtnText">تحديد موقعي (GPS) وإرسال الطلب الآن</span>
    </button>
